# Frame dumps, for a screenshot of the revealed toolbar (SHOTS=<dir>; Linux's
# headless Ozone only: on macOS scripts/mac/suite.sh reads
# compact_variants.mac.flags instead).
--ozone-dump-file={dump}
# The window at (-640, -20): headless Ozone's pointer is always at (0, 0), so
# it is over the window (1280 px wide), on the page near its top: clear of the
# window's 8 px edges and of the sidebar, as a person's pointer is after
# clicking a menu item and moving on. Otherwise it is over the sidebar, which
# then counts as hovered and stays out once the menu and the pin let go (#579).
--window-position=-640,-20
